<title>SWITZERLAND: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>WENGEN, Switzerland 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in Thursday's training run for a men's Alpine World Cup downhill on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Kristian Ghedina (Italy) two minutes 24.58 seconds</p>
<p>2. Adrien Duvillard (France) 2:24.85</p>
<p>3. Atle Skaardal (Norway) 2:24.98</p>
<p>4. Werner Franz (Austria) 2:25.18</p>
<p>5. Andreas Schifferer (Austria) 2:25.24</p>
<p>6. Luc Alphand (France) 2:25.49</p>
<p>7. Patrick Ortlieb (Austria) 2:25.50</p>
<p>8. Fritz Strobl (Austria) 2:25.52</p>
<p>9. Pietro Vitalini (Italy) 2:25.73</p>
<p>10. Josef Strobl (Austria) 2:25.82</p>
